{% block content %}{% raw %}
<section class="tour-hero">
        <h1>West Nusa Penida Tour</h1>
        <p style="font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:10px;">Dramatic Cliffs, Pristine Beaches, and Hidden Treasures</p>
    </section>

    <main class="tour-container">
        <div class="tour-grid">
            <div class="tour-description">
                <p style="font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:30px;color:#444;">Escape the ordinary and discover a hidden paradise with our exclusive private day trip to West Nusa Penida Island. Be captivated by dramatic cliffs, pristine beaches, and secret treasures. We handle every detail — from your hotel pick-up to the fast boat crossing — so you can simply enjoy one of Indonesia's most spectacular destinations.</p>
                
                <h2 class="section-heading">Tour Itinerary</h2>
                <ul class="itinerary-list">
                    <li class="itinerary-item">
                        <div class="itinerary-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-car"></i></div>
                        <div class="itinerary-details"><h3>06:30 AM – Hotel Pick-up</h3><p>Private transfer from your Bali hotel to Sanur Harbor.</p></div>
                    </li>
                    <li class="itinerary-item">
                        <div class="itinerary-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-ship"></i></div>
                        <div class="itinerary-details"><h3>07:30 AM – Fast Boat to Nusa Penida</h3><p>High-speed boat across the strait to the island (approx. 35 minutes).</p></div>
                    </li>
                    <li class="itinerary-item">
                        <div class="itinerary-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-water"></i></div>
                        <div class="itinerary-details"><h3>09:00 AM – Angel's Billabong</h3><p>Explore the stunning natural infinity pool carved into the rock face.</p></div>
                    </li>
                    <li class="itinerary-item">
                        <div class="itinerary-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-camera"></i></div>
                        <div class="itinerary-details"><h3>11:00 AM – Broken Beach</h3><p>Marvel at the spectacular circular cove and its natural rock archway.</p></div>
                    </li>
                    <li class="itinerary-item">
                        <div class="itinerary-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-mountain-sun"></i></div>
                        <div class="itinerary-details"><h3>12:00 PM – Kelingking Beach</h3><p>View the iconic T-Rex shaped cliff and take breathtaking panoramic photos.</p></div>
                    </li>
                    <li class="itinerary-item">
                        <div class="itinerary-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-utensils"></i></div>
                        <div class="itinerary-details"><h3>01:00 PM – Lunch</h3><p>Enjoy a delicious local lunch featuring Balinese or Western food.</p></div>
                    </li>
                    <li class="itinerary-item">
                        <div class="itinerary-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-umbrella-beach"></i></div>
                        <div class="itinerary-details"><h3>02:30 PM – Crystal Bay</h3><p>Relax, swim, and soak up the sun at this beautiful palm-fringed beach.</p></div>
                    </li>
                    <li class="itinerary-item">
                        <div class="itinerary-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-ship"></i></div>
                        <div class="itinerary-details"><h3>04:30 PM – Return to Bali</h3><p>Fast boat back to Sanur Harbor, then private transfer to your hotel.</p></div>
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <div class="tour-gallery">
                    <h2>Tour Gallery</h2>
                    <div class="gallery-grid">
                        <div class="gallery-item"><img src="src/assets/penida/angels-billabong.webp" alt="Angel's Billabong natural infinity pool, West Nusa Penida" fetchpriority="high" width="300" height="225"></div>
                        <div class="gallery-item"><img src="src/assets/penida/broken-beach-view.webp" alt="Broken Beach circular cove with natural rock archway, Nusa Penida" loading="lazy" width="300" height="225"></div>
                        <div class="gallery-item"><img src="src/assets/penida/broken-beach-top-view.webp" alt="Aerial view of Broken Beach, Nusa Penida" loading="lazy" width="300" height="225"></div>
                        <div class="gallery-item"><img src="src/assets/penida/kelingking-beach-view.webp" alt="Iconic T-Rex cliff at Kelingking Beach, Nusa Penida" loading="lazy" width="300" height="225"></div>
                        <div class="gallery-item"><img src="src/assets/penida/down-to-kelingking-beach.webp" alt="Trekking path down to Kelingking Beach" loading="lazy" width="300" height="225"></div>
                        <div class="gallery-item"><img src="src/assets/penida/white-sand-kelingking-beach.webp" alt="White sand beach at the base of Kelingking cliff" loading="lazy" width="300" height="225"></div>
                        <div class="gallery-item"><img src="src/assets/penida/crystal-bay-nusa-penida.webp" alt="Crystal Bay beach with clear turquoise water" loading="lazy" width="300" height="225"></div>
                        <div class="gallery-item"><img src="src/assets/penida/crystal-bay.webp" alt="Crystal Bay top view, West Nusa Penida" loading="lazy" width="300" height="225"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-section">
                    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <button class="faq-question">What is included in the West Nusa Penida tour price? <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-chevron"></i></button>
                    <div class="faq-answer"><p>The all-inclusive price covers private A/C transport to and from Sanur Harbor, return fast boat tickets, an English-speaking guide all day, all destination entrance fees (Kelingking, Broken Beach, Angel's Billabong, Crystal Bay), and a local lunch.</p></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <button class="faq-question">How long is the fast boat ride from Bali to Nusa Penida? <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-chevron"></i></button>
                    <div class="faq-answer"><p>The fast boat from Sanur Harbor takes approximately 30–45 minutes depending on sea conditions. We depart at 07:30 AM and arrive on Nusa Penida around 08:30 AM.</p></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <button class="faq-question">What is the best time of year to visit Nusa Penida? <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-chevron"></i></button>
                    <div class="faq-answer"><p>The dry season (May to October) is ideal — clear skies, calm seas, and optimal photography conditions. Roads and beaches are most accessible during this period.</p></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <button class="faq-question">Is the hike down to Kelingking Beach included? <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-chevron"></i></button>
                    <div class="faq-answer"><p>We visit the iconic T-Rex cliff viewpoint. The optional steep descent to the beach (approx. 1 hour each way) is at your own discretion — it is recommended only for guests with a good fitness level.</p></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <button class="faq-question">How far in advance should I book the West Nusa Penida tour? <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-chevron"></i></button>
                    <div class="faq-answer"><p>We recommend booking at least 2–3 days in advance, especially during peak season (June–August). Message us on WhatsApp and we will confirm availability and arrange all details immediately.</p></div>
                </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <aside>
                <div class="pricing-card">
                    <h3 style="color:var(--primary-color);font-size:1.5rem;margin-bottom:10px;">Package Pricing</h3>
                    <p style="color:#666;font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:20px;">All-Inclusive Private Tour</p>
                    <div class="price-tier">
                        <span>Group of 2</span>
                        <div class="price-amount">$65 <span class="idr-price" data-usd="65">| Rp 1.090.000</span></div>
